            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.11.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezk 11:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Eryo izooba oryaizirwa ebiteekateeko, ogire enaama mbi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.49.31"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 49:31",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ogire oti: Naaza kwinamuka, nteere ensi y'ebirorero ebitaine ngo z'amabaare, ngwe aha bantu abagaramisiriize, abatwire buhooro, boona batwire ahataine ngo z'amabaare, n'obu gaakuba amarembo againe enyigi ezirikukingwa empimbi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kunyaga eminyago n'okugitwara, okuteera emyanya eyaabiare eri amatongo, mbwenu etwirwemu, n'okuteera abantu abaataarwirwe omu mahanga bakeetungira ente n'ebintu, bakatuura ahagati y'ensi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba Sheeba na Dedani n'abahsuubuzi ba Tarushiishi n'ebirorero byabyo byona baryakubuuza nibagira bati: Beitu oizire kunyaga? Ohurwize engabo zaawe kwija kunyaga, kutwara efeeza n'ezaabu, amatungo n'ebintu, kukukumbura eminyago mingi?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
