        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "N'ahabw'ekyo, Mwana w'omuntu, hanuurira Googi, noomugira oti: Oku nikwo Mukama RUHANGA arikugamba naagira ati: Eryo izooba abantu bangye Abaisraeli ku bariba batwire buhooro, oryayehuruza, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "orugye omu mwanya gwawe gw'omu bicweka by'aha muheru gw'obukiizi-bwa-bumosho, iwe n'amahanga maingi agari hamwe naiwe, boona bari aha mbaraasi, eihe rihango kandi ry'amaani, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 38:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "oteere abantu bangye Israeli, ori nk'ekicu ekishwekire ensi. Omu biro by'aha muheru ndyakuteeza ensi yangye, amahanga gabone kummanya, ku ndiba naakweyorekyeiremu, ku ndi Orikwera, iwe Googi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.38.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.38.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
